848
00:52:21,037 --> 00:52:22,018
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh, this is what arahant is.

849
00:52:22,078 --> 00:52:22,999
[SPEAKER_00]: This is what sotāpādā is.

850
00:52:23,099 --> 00:52:24,060
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay, and I'm... No.

